    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A tragic lady transformed into a Succubus through a Mystic's curse. She loved a prince of the Waltner family of Gludio, but was tricked into murdering him. Now, she feeds on the energy of travelers in Gludio, delaying her death day by day. Demons Lv. 9 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Demons. M. Atk. +10 Atk. Spd. +5% Vampiric Rage effect +1% Bow Skill Vampiric Rage effect +2% Resistance to Dark +10% P. Def. -5% Resistance to Holy -10% Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. Dark Attack Lv. 1 Unleashes a dark attack. Dark Attack Resistance Lv. 5 Resistant to Dark attacks. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
